---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Shot from "../components/Shot.astro";
---

<Base title="Press" description="UTG – Up To Game Pro press kit: boilerplate, icon, and screenshots. No invented awards or download counts." path="/press">
  <div class="wrap page-hero">
    <p class="kicker">Press</p>
    <h1>UTG in one paragraph</h1>
    <p>Use this boilerplate. Do not invent awards, rankings, or download counts — we do not publish those figures here.</p>
    <p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/press/utg-press-kit.zip" download>Download press kit (zip)</a>
    </p>
  </div>
  <article class="wrap legal">
    <h2>Boilerplate</h2>
    <p>
      UTG – Up To Game Pro is an iOS 18+ game companion. Players discover games via IGDB, follow release dates, track prices, keep collections in iCloud, and use optional AI recommendations, chat, and Buy/Wait verdicts. The app also surfaces Epic / Game Pass / giveaway catalogs and, with permission, weather and a map for local play. It supports widgets, Live Activities, and Apple Watch. Sign-in with Apple, Google, or Firebase is optional. UTG Pro+ is an Apple In-App Purchase.
    </p>
    <h2>Facts</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Name: UTG – Up To Game Pro</li>
      <li>Platform: iOS / iPadOS 18+, Apple Watch (watchOS 11)</li>
      <li>App Store ID: 1480143119</li>
      <li>Listing: <a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/utg-up-to-game-pro/id1480143119">App Store</a></li>
      <li>Operator: Yad3V, Saudi Arabia</li>
      <li>Press contact: <a class="mail" href="mailto:yad3v.dev@gmail.com">yad3v.dev@gmail.com</a></li>
    </ul>
    <h2>What’s in the zip</h2>
    <p>Icon, screenshots (search, this-month list, favorites, upcoming countdown, weather, Buy or Wait), and a README with this boilerplate. Do not invent mock reviews.</p>
    <div class="press-thumbs">
      <figure>
        <Shot src="/assets/app-icon.png" width={128} height={128} alt="UTG app icon" />
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <Shot src="/assets/search.png" alt="Search" />
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <Shot src="/assets/catalog.png" alt="Out this month" />
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <Shot src="/assets/favorites.png" alt="Favorites" />
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <Shot src="/assets/hero-countdown.png" alt="Upcoming countdown" />
      </figure>
    </div>
    <p>Legal: <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a> · <a href="/terms">Terms (EULA)</a> · <a href="/subscription">Subscriptions</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
